# exp62 artifact hygiene -- EXPERIMENT-ONLY; builds its own pybind module. Keep curated source and
# (later, from Slice 3+) the curated band aggregate / pair manifest trackable; ignore build outputs
# and raw per-run smoke artifacts.

# build / python scratch
build/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.so
*.dylib
*.o
*.a

# raw per-run scratch
_exp62_runs/

# raw logs
*.log
hpx.parcel.*.log
logs/

# Raw per-run smoke / dry-run / band-island artifacts (Slice 1 local smokes, Slice 2 one-remote
# dry-run, Slice 3 raw band islands exp62_fanout_<bandid>_i<k>_{hpx,ray}.json). Reproducible scratch;
# stay ignored. The TRACKABLE Slice 3 curated artifacts DO NOT match these patterns and remain
# trackable:
#   - exp62_fanout_<bandid>_i<k>_manifest.json   (per matched island)
#   - exp62_fanout_band_<job>_aggregate.json     (one combined aggregate)
exp62_fanout_*_hpx.json
exp62_fanout_*_ray.json
exp62_fanout_*_witness.json
exp62_fanout_*_attest.json
